       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. ZPS09B.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  COUNTER-NUM PIC 99 VALUE 10.
       LOCAL-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  LOCAL-NUM PIC 99 VALUE 12.
       01  LOCAL-TEXT PIC X(4) VALUE 'INIT'.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01  ANSWER-TEXT PIC X(8).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING ANSWER-TEXT.
           STRING COUNTER-NUM LOCAL-NUM LOCAL-TEXT
             INTO ANSWER-TEXT END-STRING.
           ADD 1 TO COUNTER-NUM.
           MOVE 99 TO LOCAL-NUM.
           MOVE 'USED' TO LOCAL-TEXT.
           GOBACK.
       END PROGRAM ZPS09B.
